{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For refuge from the avenger.</b> Because of the fear of the blood avenger, the relative of the slain." "<b>And the slayer shall not die.</b> Since it says ״ורצח גואל הדם את הרצח״, I might think he may kill him on his own initiative. Scripture therefore says <b>and the slayer shall not die</b> until he stands before the congregation for judgment."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:43.073640075Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}